<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-houhanshu" book-id="b-houhanshu-042" chapter-id="c-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou" source-id="s-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou-ws1549947">
  <p id="c-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou:p001:m0000" ref="6c9_c43_555">光武皇帝</persName>十一子：郭皇后生東海恭王強、沛獻王輔、濟南安王康、阜陵質王延、中山簡王焉，許美人生楚王英，<persName id="c-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou:p001:m0049" ref="pdw_8ej_kps">光烈皇后</persName>生<persName id="c-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou:p001:m0054" ref="rdh_7yg_9xk">顯宗</persName>、東平憲王蒼、<persName id="c-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou:p001:m0063" ref="6c9_c43_555_A">廣陵思王荊</persName></p>
  <p id="c-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou:p002:m0000" ref="rdh_7yg_9xk">顯宗</persName>以<persName id="c-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou:p002:m0003" ref="6c9_c43_555_A">荊</persName>母弟，秘其事，遣<persName id="c-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou:p002:m0012" ref="6c9_c43_555_A">荊</persName>出止河南宮。</p>
  <p id="c-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou:p003:m0000" ref="6c9_c43_555_A">荊</persName>猶不改。其後使巫祭祀祝詛，有司舉奏，請誅之，<persName id="c-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou:p003:m0023" ref="6c9_c43_555_A">荊</persName>自殺。立二十九年死。帝憐傷之，賜謚曰思王。</p>
</text>
